<section class="sec earn" id="earn"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro rv"><h2 class="h2">Your earnings, three ways</h2><p class="lede">Members pay the price you set, and you keep 90% of it. You also earn a share of the trading fee on trades placed from your Valuations, and from the D1 seat on any asset you hold.</p></div><div class="cards3"><article class="ecard rv" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="icon52" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.4-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.7 1.9 6.5 5.5M16 4.8a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 6.4M18 14.8c1.8.7 3 2.4 3.5 5.2"></path></svg></div>
    <div><div class="lab">When investors become members</div><h3>Memberships</h3></div><p>Offer any mix of your Valuations, newsletter, model portfolio and direct chat in memberships, at the price you set.</p><hr>
    <div class="erow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21v-9M12 12c0-4 2.5-7 7-7 0 4-2.5 7-7 7zM12 15c0-3-2-5.5-6-5.5 0 3 2 5.5 6 5.5z"></path></svg><div><div class="t">90% of your price</div><div class="b">Delphi One keeps 10%, the same cut as Substack.</div></div></div>
    <div class="erow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0zM7 6H4a3 3 0 0 0 3 4M17 6h3a3 3 0 0 1-3 4M12 14v4M8 21h8"></path></svg><div><div class="t">Replication included</div><div class="b">Members Replicate your model portfolio in one click.</div></div></div></article><article class="ecard rv" style="transition-delay:80ms"><div class="icon52" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 2l4 4-4 4M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14M7 22l-4-4 4-4M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"></path></svg></div>
    <div><div class="lab">When investors trade on your ideas</div><h3>Your Valuations</h3></div><p>Investors can trade right next to your Valuation, and every trade placed from it sends you part of the trading fee.</p><hr>
    <div class="erow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v4M3 7v11a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15V9H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zM16 14.5h.01"></path></svg><div><div class="t">10% of the trading fee</div><div class="b">On every trade placed from your Valuations</div></div></div>
    <div class="erow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="3"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="10" r="2.2"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="10" r="2.2"></circle><path d="M7 20c.6-3 2.6-5 5-5s4.4 2 5 5M1.5 19c.3-2 1.6-3.5 3.5-3.5M22.5 19c-.3-2-1.6-3.5-3.5-3.5"></path></svg><div><div class="t">On any asset</div><div class="b">You don’t need the D1 seat to earn from your Valuations</div></div></div></article><article class="ecard rv" style="transition-delay:160ms"><div class="icon52" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 9h15l-4-4M20 15H5l4 4"></path></svg></div>
    <div><div class="lab">When you lead an asset</div><h3>The D1 seat</h3></div><p>Hold an asset’s D1 seat and you earn on trades of that asset that don’t come from another analyst’s Valuation.</p><hr>
    <div class="erow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10171e" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 3H6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V8zM14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6"></path></svg><div><div class="t">10% of the trading fee</div><div class="b">On trades of the asset you lead</div></div></div>
